WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.572 --> 00:00:07.734
and her family were enjoying dessert.

2
00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:11.217
Everyone loved Mother's chocolate almond cake.

3
00:00:11.757 --> 00:00:13.739
But Annie was not feeling well.

4
00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:18.023
"Mom, can I save my piece for tomorrow?"

5
00:00:18.463 --> 00:00:19.063
she asked.

6
00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:23.247
"Annie, are you sure you want to save your cake?"

7
00:00:24.068 --> 00:00:24.668
asked Dad.

8
00:00:24.688 --> 00:00:26.810
"What if it spoils?"

9
00:00:27.611 --> 00:00:28.912
asked her sister Molly.

10
00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:33.975
"It won't taste good tomorrow," said Jesse, one of the twins.

11
00:00:33.995 --> 00:00:36.737
"What if you're still sick tomorrow?"

12
00:00:37.398 --> 00:00:38.899
said Jake, the other twin.

13
00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:41.942
"Please do not touch my cake!"

14
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:43.203
Annie said.

15
00:00:48.427 --> 00:00:50.489
morning! How are you feeling?"

16
00:00:51.549 --> 00:00:53.131
asked Mother the next morning.

17
00:00:53.151 --> 00:00:55.052
"I feel great!"

18
00:00:55.793 --> 00:00:56.473
answered Annie.

19
00:00:57.354 --> 00:00:59.236
Annie opened the refrigerator door.

20
00:01:00.432 --> 00:01:01.272
"Oh no!"

21
00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:02.553
she shouted.

22
00:01:02.573 --> 00:01:04.834
"My cake is gone!

23
00:01:07.955 --> 00:01:09.116
Who ate my cake?"

24
00:01:09.536 --> 00:01:10.176
she asked.

25
00:01:10.196 --> 00:01:13.338
"Not me," said Molly.

26
00:01:13.358 --> 00:01:16.679
"It wasn't me," said Jesse.

27
00:01:16.699 --> 00:01:19.980
"Don't look at me," said Jake.

28
00:01:21.301 --> 00:01:23.302
Annie's parents shrugged their shoulders.

29
00:01:23.322 --> 00:01:28.524
"One of you is not telling the truth," Annie said.

30
00:01:29.432 --> 00:01:31.634
"Someone in this room ate my cake!

31
00:01:32.495 --> 00:01:34.896
And I am going to find out who did it!"

32
00:01:37.538 --> 00:01:40.240
Annie asked her family to leave the kitchen.

33
00:01:41.021 --> 00:01:43.563
She wanted to search the area for clues.

34
00:01:46.245 --> 00:01:48.887
There were no dishes or cups in the sink.

35
00:01:49.527 --> 00:01:50.688
It was very clean.

36
00:01:51.689 --> 00:01:52.970
Annie opened the cupboard.

37
00:01:53.791 --> 00:01:55.432
One of the cups was missing.

38
00:01:57.392 --> 00:01:59.733
Annie opened the lid to the garbage can.

39
00:02:00.374 --> 00:02:02.455
She found the wrapper from her cake.

40
00:02:03.336 --> 00:02:05.797
There was also a fresh banana peel.

41
00:02:07.778 --> 00:02:10.680
Annie asked everyone to meet her in the living room.

42
00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:16.083
"I would like to ask you some questions," announced Annie.

43
00:02:16.103 --> 00:02:18.844
"Let's start with you, Dad.

44
00:02:19.365 --> 00:02:21.666
What time did you go to sleep last night?"

45
00:02:21.686 --> 00:02:24.828
"About eleven," he answered.

46
00:02:25.804 --> 00:02:27.545
"Did you wake up during the night?"

47
00:02:28.566 --> 00:02:29.366
"Yes, I did.

48
00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:32.168
I went to the bathroom," he said.

49
00:02:32.188 --> 00:02:36.550
"Did you wake up during the night?"

50
00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.331
Annie asked her mother.

51
00:02:38.351 --> 00:02:41.673
"I woke up twice," she answered.

52
00:02:41.693 --> 00:02:47.096
"Once when your father got up, and the other time was about six o'clock."

53
00:02:47.116 --> 00:02:49.537
"What woke you up then?"

54
00:02:49.998 --> 00:02:50.658
Annie asked.

55
00:02:50.678 --> 00:02:53.920
"I thought I heard a sound from the kitchen."

56
00:02:56.328 --> 00:02:59.470
"I got up at about twelve because I was thirsty.

57
00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.832
I drank some milk," Molly said.

58
00:03:02.852 --> 00:03:05.053
"Where is your cup?"

59
00:03:06.013 --> 00:03:07.294
Annie asked her sister.

60
00:03:08.475 --> 00:03:10.656
Molly got up and left the living room.

61
00:03:10.676 --> 00:03:16.259
"I went to sleep at ten and woke up at eight this morning," said Jesse.

62
00:03:16.279 --> 00:03:21.782
"So I couldn't have eaten your cake, unless I was sleepwalking."

63
00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.884
Molly returned and gave a cup to Annie.

64
00:03:27.056 --> 00:03:29.197
It was the missing cup from the cupboard.

65
00:03:29.217 --> 00:03:32.138
"Did you get up during the night?"

66
00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:33.718
she asked Jake.

67
00:03:34.758 --> 00:03:38.439
"No, uh, wait, yes, I did," he said.

68
00:03:38.459 --> 00:03:40.680
"What time was that?"

69
00:03:41.380 --> 00:03:41.960
asked Annie.

70
00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:45.902
"Uh, I think it was about one or two."

71
00:03:45.922 --> 00:03:48.042
"Why did you get up?"

72
00:03:49.323 --> 00:03:50.043
"I was hungry.

73
00:03:50.223 --> 00:03:53.604
So, uh, I ate a banana," said Jake.

74
00:03:55.664 --> 00:03:57.105
Annie looked at her notebook.

75
00:03:58.066 --> 00:04:00.907
"I know who ate my cake," she announced.

76
00:04:02.048 --> 00:04:03.549
Annie looked at each person.

77
00:04:04.449 --> 00:04:06.530
Then her eyes rested on Jake.

78
00:04:07.851 --> 00:04:09.172
"It was Jake."

79
00:04:11.213 --> 00:04:12.974
"H-h-how did you know?"

80
00:04:13.554 --> 00:04:14.155
he asked.

81
00:04:14.975 --> 00:04:15.876
Annie explained.

82
00:04:15.896 --> 00:04:19.718
"Mom said she heard a noise around six in the morning.

83
00:04:20.879 --> 00:04:23.080
Someone must have been up at that time.

84
00:04:24.108 --> 00:04:26.829
But my biggest clue was the banana peel.

85
00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:33.152
If you ate the banana around one or two, the peel would already be dark.

86
00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:37.214
But when I saw it, it was still yellow.

87
00:04:38.055 --> 00:04:39.915
That's how I knew you were lying."

88
00:04:41.516 --> 00:04:43.957
Jake admitted that he ate Annie's cake.

89
00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:46.018
He apologized to Annie.

90
00:04:46.678 --> 00:04:49.620
No one knew Annie was such a good detective!
